---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Societies
heading: Society golf days
intro: A warm invitation to societies and corporate groups — a fine, well-managed course, a friendly clubhouse and a dedicated society organiser.
hero: /assets/images/penn-4.jpg
---
<div class="prose-club">
  <p>Penn Golf Club is easy to reach yet set in rural surroundings, with stunning views to the Clee Hills. Our experienced team is on hand throughout to make your day enjoyable and memorable. An extensive menu of quality home-cooked food is served all day, every day.</p>
  <p>We have a well-stocked Golf Shop with helpful, professional staff and a dedicated in-house society organiser to look after your every need. Whatever the size of your group, we can guarantee you a great day out.</p>
</div>

<section class="mt-12" aria-labelledby="pk-h">
  <p class="eyebrow">{{ societies.season }}</p>
  <h2 id="pk-h" class="mt-2 font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-heath-900">Summer society packages</h2>
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3">
    {%- for p in societies.packages %}
    <div class="card relative flex flex-col p-6 {{ 'ring-2 !ring-gorse-500' if p.featured }}">
      {%- if p.featured %}<span class="absolute -top-3 left-6 rounded-full bg-gorse-500 px-3 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold text-heath-950">Most popular</span>{% endif %}
      <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ p.name }}</h3>
      <p class="mt-2 flex-1 text-heath-700">{{ p.includes }}</p>
      <dl class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 border-t border-heath-950/10 pt-4">
        <div><dt class="text-xs text-heath-600">Mon–Fri</dt><dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ p.weekday | money2 }}</dd></div>
        <div><dt class="text-xs text-heath-600">Sunday</dt><dd class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ p.sunday | money2 }}</dd></div>
      </dl>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gorse-300/50 p-6">
      <p class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-heath-900">Lunch can be added to any package from {{ societies.lunchFrom | money }}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ul class="mt-6 space-y-2 text-sm text-heath-700">
    {%- for t in societies.terms %}<li class="flex gap-2">{% icon "info", "size-4 text-crest-500 mt-0.5" %}<span>{{ t }}</span></li>{% endfor %}
  </ul>
</section>

<section class="mt-14" aria-labelledby="menu-h">
  <h2 id="menu-h" class="font-display text-3xl font-semibold text-heath-900">Society party catering</h2>
  <p class="mt-2 text-heath-700">Minimum {{ societies.catering.minimum }} guests. {{ societies.catering.note }}</p>
  {%- set c = societies.catering %}
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    {%- for sec in [{ t: "On arrival", items: c.arrival }, { t: "Lunch", items: c.lunch }, { t: "Dinner", items: c.dinner }] %}
    <div class="card p-6">
      <h3 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ sec.t }}</h3>
      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-3">
        {%- for i in sec.items %}
        <li>
          <div class="flex items-baseline gap-2"><span class="text-heath-800">{{ i.item }}</span><span class="flex-1 border-b border-dotted border-heath-300"></span><span class="font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ i.price | money2 }}</span></div>
          {%- if i.note %}<p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-heath-600">{{ i.note }}</p>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {%- endfor %}
      </ul>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="card mt-6 grid gap-6 p-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    {%- for sec in [{ t: "Starters", items: c.starters }, { t: "Main course", items: c.mains }, { t: "Desserts", items: c.desserts }] %}
    <div>
      <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-semibold text-heath-900">{{ sec.t }}</h3>
      <ul class="mt-2 space-y-1 text-heath-800">{% for i in sec.items %}<li>{{ i }}</li>{% endfor %}</ul>
      {%- if sec.t == "Desserts" %}<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-heath-600">{{ c.dessertNote }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-heath-700">{{ c.coffee.item }} {{ c.coffee.price | money2 }}</p>
  <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
    {%- set doc = documents.societyPackages %}{% include "partials/doc-link.njk" %}
    {%- set doc = documents.societyMenu %}{% include "partials/doc-link.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<div class="mt-14">
{%- set form = {
  name: "society-enquiry",
  title: "Plan your society day",
  intro: "Tell us about your group and our society organiser will come back to you with availability.",
  submit: "Send society enquiry",
  extra: [
    { name: "society", label: "Society / company name", required: true },
    { name: "players", label: "Number of players", type: "number", required: true },
    { name: "date", label: "Preferred date", type: "date" },
    { name: "package", label: "Package", type: "select", options: ["Starter", "Bronze", "Silver", "Gold", "Platinum", "Not sure yet"] },
    { name: "message", label: "Anything else we should know?", type: "textarea" }
  ]
} %}
{% include "partials/enquiry-form.njk" %}
</div>
